# Source: https://genome.ucsc.edu/FAQ/FAQformat.html#format1
#   https://github.com/arq5x/bedtools2/issues/919
# Symptom: BED12 where blockCount (col 10) does not match the actual number
#   of entries in blockSizes (col 11) and blockStarts (col 12); here blockCount
#   says 3 but only 2 values are provided in the lists.  UCSC bigBed converter
#   and bedtools reject with "blockCount does not match number of blocks".
#   Arises from off-by-one in loop that builds the comma-separated lists.
# Format: chrom start end name score strand thickStart thickEnd itemRgb blockCount blockSizes blockStarts
chr1	1000	5000	tx1	0	+	1200	4800	0	3	200,300	0,1500
chr2	10000	20000	tx2	0	-	10200	19500	0	4	300,500,400	0,4000,8000
